.\" Man page for the client program
.TH CLIENT 1 "2026-09-24" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test driver for the libmyutils library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
tests every function of the libmyutils library and prints each result
next to its expected value.
.PP
It first tests the string functions
.BR mystrlen (3),
.BR mystrcpy (3),
.BR mystrncpy (3)
and
.BR mystrcat (3).
It then creates a temporary file named
.I test_input.txt
in the current directory, tests
.BR wordCount (3)
and
.BR mygrep (3)
on it, and deletes it.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success, and 1 if the test file cannot be created or opened.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mystrlen (3),
.BR mygrep (3)
